    "detailed_description": "<strong>Simple Story:</strong><br>four thieves decided to steal a house. They found out the owner is a killer, but the real problem is they can't leave the house! The owner made a game for the thieves if they lose, they will all die or if they win, they will leave the house.<br><strong>About The Game:</strong><br>The game simulate The thieves situation and you will deal with that. It has levels playable with party or single, In every level has a boss and you will deal with the boss to win the game, but if you didn't deal with him, you will die.<br><strong>Stealth</strong><br>Stealth to your goal and avoid the monster. If the monster catched you, he will kill you.<br><strong>Help Each Other</strong><br>Be helpful with your friends and help each other to escape the house with the items.",
